0.2 08.09.2026
* default config now sets stale = 600 so a backlog posted after an outage is
  dropped instead of being stored as current data
* fixed wind speed and gusts: to_METRICWX yields m/s, wetterblick expects km/h
* send the archive interval rain amount instead of rainRate (mm/h)
* renamed the daily rain parameter to rainDay -- query parameters are
  case-sensitive, rainday was silently discarded by the server
* username/password are the station name and the station key from
  https://www.wetterblick.com/netzwerk

0.1 27.02.2026
* initial version, adapted from Matthew Wall
